 gcc/config/darwin.h |  3 ++-
 gcc/configure       | 11 ++++++++--
 gcc/configure.ac    |  6 ++++++
 gcc/exec-tool.in    | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 5 files changed, 64 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

